scene U: {N} looks at the certificate and is already wondering what the next grade asks for, and the one after that.
scene B: {rival} only got a pass. {N} got a merit, and intends to make sure everybody knows it.
scene R: {N} reads the result, whoops, and runs to find {friend}.
scene G: {grandparent} holds the certificate up to the light and says nobody in the family ever had one of these. {N} feels it go right through.
